  "plainEnglish": "In plain terms: Binds session and resource lifecycles with strict timeouts to prevent stale state abuse in Static Analysis, SAST & Taint Invariants. This ensures that every transaction is verified against CWE-613 before state changes take place, preventing unauthorized bypasses and maintaining strict boundary integrity.",
